      "problem": "Expand and simplify $(y + 5)(y - 2).$",
      "worked_solution": "We take each term of the first binomial and multiply it by the second binomial. Then, we simplify by collecting like terms.\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\t(y + 5)(y - 2) &= \\\n\t\ty(y-2) + 5(y-2) &=\\\n\t\ty^2-2y +5y-10 &=\\\n\t\ty^2 + 3y - 10\n\t}\n$$",
